{
  "title": "OccluderTileLayer",
  "description": "What TilemapOccluder needs of a tile layer: its cell metrics, a way to walk the cells of a region, and a revision that changes when the cells do. Structural on purpose, and generic over whatever a layer calls a tile, so `@codexo/exojs-tilemap`'s `TileLayer` satisfies it as it stands while this package depends on neither it nor physics. Anything else that can answer \"which cells are occupied around here\" works as well.",
